       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. N08ROUND.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-A           PIC S9(3)V99 VALUE 8.75.
       01 WS-RESULT      PIC S9(3)V9 VALUE 0.
       01 WS-RESULT2     PIC S9(3)V9 VALUE 0.
       01 WS-BIG         PIC S9(2)V9 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           COMPUTE WS-RESULT ROUNDED = WS-A
           COMPUTE WS-RESULT2 = WS-A
           COMPUTE WS-BIG ROUNDED = 999.96
           DISPLAY "ROUNDED=" WS-RESULT
           DISPLAY "TRUNCATED=" WS-RESULT2
           DISPLAY "BIG=" WS-BIG
           STOP RUN.
